{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Stop, turn, and go all out toward the destination! </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>One collision and the game\u2019s over!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3764260/extras/001.png?t=1750147215\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>The demo version of the game includes:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u30fb7 tutorial stages</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u30fb3 demo-exclusive stages</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0Stage1-Lv1 Easy</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0Stage2-Lv2 Casual</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0Stage3-Lv4 Challenging</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>What is Pocket &amp; Zooom?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Pocket &amp; Zooom is a puzzle game in which you give commands to aircraft to guide them to their destinations. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Players can give only six kinds of commands.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">It's more difficult than it sounds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Create a strategy to get the aircraft to their destinations!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>How to play Pocket &amp; Zooom</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>[Always keep your eye on the airport!]</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Aircraft move steadily towards their destinations, but without your guidance they can easily collide with other aircraft or obstacles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Keep a close eye on conditions at the airport, quickly find aircraft that are heading into dangerous situations and avoid the danger.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3764260/extras/02.gif?t=1750147215\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>[Give commands to the aircraft!]</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use &quot;command cards&quot; to keep the aircraft away from danger.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Choose the appropriate command from six command cards, including &quot;Stop&quot; and &quot;Change Route,&quot; to guide the aircraft to their destinations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3764260/extras/03.gif?t=1750147215\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>[Be careful not to use too many cards!]</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">After using a card, there is a \u201ccooldown\u201d time during which you have to wait before you can use another card. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Think carefully about timing when you use a card.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3764260/extras/04.gif?t=1750147215\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <strong>[Guide all the aircraft to their destinations!]</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Safely avoid various dangers and get the aircraft to their destinations to be a hero!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">If you only had to guide one aircraft it might be easy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">But with each new stage, the number of aircraft increases and the dangers become more frequent.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Guide all the aircraft to their destinations to clear the stage!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3764260/extras/05.gif?t=1750147215\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3764260?t=1750147215","background_raw":"htt