ragraph\"><strong>[Always keep your eye on the airport!]</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Aircraft move steadily towards their destinations, but without your guidance they can easily collide with other aircraft or obstacles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Keep a close eye on conditions at the airport, quickly find aircraft that are heading into dangerous situations and avoid the danger.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3764260/extras/02.gif?t=1750147215\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>[Give commands to the aircraft!]</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use &quot;command cards&quot; to keep the aircraft away from danger.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Choose the appropriate command from six command cards, including &quot;Stop&quot; and &quot;Change Route,&quot; to guide the aircraft to their destinations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3764260/extras/03.gif?t=1750147215\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>[Be careful not to use too many cards!]</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">After using a card, there is a \u201ccooldown\u201d time during which you have to wait before you can use another card. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Think carefully about timing when you use a card.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3764260/extras/04.gif?t=1750147215\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <strong>[Guide all the aircraft to their destinations!]</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Safely avoid various dangers and get the aircraft to their destinations to be a hero!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">If you only had to guide one aircraft it might be easy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">But with each new stage, the number of aircraft increases and the dangers become more frequent.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Guide all the aircraft to their destinations to clear the stage!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3764260/extras/05.gif?t=1750147215\" /></p>","developers":["TechnoBrain"],"fullgame":{"appid":"1453680","name":"Pocket and Zooom"},"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3764260/cd0a6b0479a7bfe83db88d4e9d547a92a8a1cb6c/header.jpg?t=1750147215","is_free":true,"legal_notice":"\u00a9 TechnoBrain CO.,LTD. All Rights Reserved.","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257143199,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257143199/movie480.mp4?t=1750041205","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257143199/movie_max.mp4?t=1750041205"},"name":"Pocket and Zooom Demo","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257143199/580faca03fceccc7394637abc26737222fef41e9/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1750041205","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257143199/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1750041205","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257143199/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1750041205"}}],"name":"Pocket and Zooom Demo","pa